# TextStats

TextStats is being prepared as a Python 3.11+ text statistics API and command-line utility. No product implementation is available yet. The [project brief](docs/dev/PROJECT.md) captures the requested capabilities and delivery boundaries; runnable usage instructions will be added with the documentation milestone.

Development uses [SDD Manager](SDD-MANAGER.md). See the [AI-assisted development disclosure](AI_DISCLOSURE.md).
